# The nxbuild release the app bundles as its experimental builder (Contents/Resources/nxbuild/nxb, LNPANDY/NX2Apple#749).
# build-mac-app.yml and tools/try-local run `frontend/tools/nxbuild.py fetch`: download the zip, check its SHA-256 against the line
# below, unpack nxb and sign it ad hoc. `frontend/tools/nxbuild.py bump <version>` writes a new version with its digest from the
# release's SHA256SUMS. A sha256 of PLACEHOLDER (no release yet) bundles nothing, and the setting then needs a chosen nxb.
version	0.9.0
sha256	989ba29f7971f6168a23c704aed3a216af776b4db74efba99d3271c38b9372f8
url	https://github.com/v0lumehi/nxkit/releases/download/v{version}/nxb-v{version}-macos-arm64.zip
